# Intentionally a no-op.
#
# analysis.track_in_git is true for this board: deep_review.json is
# hand-authored and NOT regenerable, and the analyzer JSON is slow to
# rebuild. This file exists only to hold the slot -- all three writers
# (analysis_cache.ensure_analysis_dir, analyze_schematic.py and
# analyze_pcb.py) create a real ignore file when none is present, and
# analyze_pcb.py does so unconditionally, ignoring track_in_git.
# Deleting this file will silently re-ignore the whole directory on the
# next PCB run. Leave it here.
